@loca HW_MOOD_ACCEPTING_DESC The fading echo of Trust. <LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass">Armour Class</LSTag> increased by 1.
@loca HW_EMOTION_ADMIRATION_NAME Emotion: Admiration
@loca HW_EMOTION_ADMIRATION_DESC Trust surged again on its own echo. <LSTag Tooltip="Resistant">Resistant</LSTag> to all damage. Cannot be <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CHARMED">Charmed</LSTag> or <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FRIGHTENED">Frightened</LSTag>.
@loca HW_EMOTION_FEAR_NAME Emotion: Fear
@loca HW_EMOTION_FEAR_DESC Surging with Fear. Frozen with fear: can't move. Has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck">Ability Checks</LSTag> and <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag>.
@loca HW_MOOD_APPREHENSIVE_NAME Mood: Apprehensive
@loca HW_MOOD_APPREHENSIVE_DESC The fading echo of Fear. Subtracts 1d4 from Wisdom <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throws</LSTag>.
@loca HW_EMOTION_TERROR_NAME Emotion: Terror
@loca HW_EMOTION_TERROR_DESC Fear surged again on its own echo. Flees in terror. Has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck">Ability Checks</LSTag> and <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag>.
@loca HW_EMOTION_SURPRISE_NAME Emotion: Surprise
@loca HW_EMOTION_SURPRISE_DESC Surging with Surprise. Caught off guard: can't take reactions, and the next attack against it has <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag>.
@loca HW_MOOD_DISTRACTED_NAME Mood: Distracted
@loca HW_MOOD_DISTRACTED_DESC The fading echo of Surprise. Has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throws</LSTag> to maintain Concentration.
@loca HW_EMOTION_AMAZEMENT_NAME Emotion: Amazement
@loca HW_EMOTION_AMAZEMENT_DESC Surprise surged again on its own echo. <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STUNNED">Stunned</LSTag>: can't move or take actions or reactions. Automatically fails Strength and Dexterity <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throws</LSTag>, and attacks against it have <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag>.
@loca HW_EMOTION_SADNESS_NAME Emotion: Sadness
@loca HW_EMOTION_SADNESS_DESC Surging with Sadness. Lets go of what it holds: loses Concentration and can't take bonus actions.
@loca HW_MOOD_PENSIVE_NAME Mood: Pensive
@loca HW_MOOD_PENSIVE_DESC The fading echo of Sadness. <LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed">Movement speed</LSTag> reduced by [1].
@loca HW_EMOTION_GRIEF_NAME Emotion: Grief
@loca HW_EMOTION_GRIEF_DESC Sadness surged again on its own echo. Incapacitated: can't move or take actions, bonus actions or reactions.
@loca HW_EMOTION_DISGUST_NAME Emotion: Disgust
@loca HW_EMOTION_DISGUST_DESC Surging with Disgust. Can't take actions. Has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on Constitution <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throws</LSTag>.
@loca HW_MOOD_BORED_NAME Mood: Bored
@loca HW_MOOD_BORED_DESC The fading echo of Disgust. Can't take reactions.
@loca HW_EMOTION_LOATHING_NAME Emotion: Loathing
@loca HW_EMOTION_LOATHING_DESC Disgust surged again on its own echo. Can't take actions or bonus actions. Has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> and <LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck">Ability Checks</LSTag>.
@loca HW_EMOTION_ANGER_NAME Emotion: Anger
@loca HW_EMOTION_ANGER_DESC Surging with Anger. Bears a grudge: attacks the last creature that hurt it, or the nearest one if nobody has.
@loca HW_MOOD_ANNOYED_NAME Mood: Annoyed
@loca HW_MOOD_ANNOYED_DESC The fading echo of Anger. <LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass">Armour Class</LSTag> reduced by 1.
@loca HW_EMOTION_RAGE_NAME Emotion: Rage
@loca HW_EMOTION_RAGE_DESC Anger surged again on its own echo. Bears a grudge: attacks the last creature that hurt it, or the nearest one if nobody has, with <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag>. Attacks against it also have Advantage.
@loca HW_EMOTION_ANTICIPATION_NAME Emotion: Anticipation
@loca HW_EMOTION_ANTICIPATION_DESC Surging with Anticipation. On guard: when an enemy enters its reach, it can use its reaction to attack first.
@loca HW_MOOD_INTERESTED_NAME Mood: Interested
@loca HW_MOOD_INTERESTED_DESC The fading echo of Anticipation. <LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed">Movement speed</LSTag> increased by [1].
@loca HW_EMOTION_VIGILANCE_NAME Emotion: Vigilance
@loca HW_EMOTION_VIGILANCE_DESC Anticipation surged again on its own echo. Has 2 additional reactions and <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag> on Dexterity <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throws</LSTag>.
@loca HW_FEELING_AGGRESSIVENESS_NAME Feeling: Aggressiveness
@loca HW_FEELING_AGGRESSIVENESS_DESC Anger and Anticipation, braided together. Weapon attacks deal an additional [1]. Has an additional reaction.
@loca HW_FEELING_ANXIETY_NAME Feeling: Anxiety
@loca HW_FEELING_ANXIETY_DESC Fear and Anticipation, braided together. Loses Concentration. Can't take reactions and has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throws</LSTag> to maintain Concentration.
@loca HW_FEELING_AWE_NAME Feeling: Awe
@loca HW_FEELING_AWE_DESC Fear and Surprise, braided together. Incapacitated: can't move or take actions, bonus actions or reactions. Taking damage ends the effect.
@loca HW_FEELING_CONTEMPT_NAME Feeling: Contempt
@loca HW_FEELING_CONTEMPT_DESC Disgust and Anger, braided together. <LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</LSTag> to Psychic damage.
@loca HW_FEELING_CURIOSITY_NAME Feeling: Curiosity
@loca HW_FEELING_CURIOSITY_DESC Trust and Surprise, braided together. Has <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck">Ability Checks</LSTag>, <LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed">movement speed</LSTag> increased by [1], and can see <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="INVISIBLE">Invisible</LSTag> creatures.
@loca HW_FEELING_CYNICISM_NAME Feeling: Cynicism
@loca HW_FEELING_CYNICISM_DESC Disgust and Anticipation, braided together. Can't regain hit points.
@loca HW_FEELING_DELIGHT_NAME Feeling: Delight
@loca HW_FEELING_DELIGHT_DESC Joy and Surprise, braided together. Regains [1] at the end of each turn.
@loca HW_FEELING_DESPAIR_NAME Feeling: Despair
@loca HW_FEELING_DESPAIR_DESC Fear and Sadness, braided together. Subtracts 1d4 from <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> and <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throws</LSTag>.
@loca HW_FEELING_DISAPPROVAL_NAME Feeling: Disapproval
@loca HW_FEELING_DISAPPROVAL_DESC Surprise and Sadness, braided together. Its allies within [1] have <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag>.
@loca HW_FEELING_DOMINANCE_NAME Feeling: Dominance
@loca HW_FEELING_DOMINANCE_DESC Trust and Anger, braided together. Has <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag> on Athletics and Intimidation checks. <LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass">Armour Class</LSTag> increased by 1.
@loca HW_FEELING_ENVY_NAME Feeling: Envy
@loca HW_FEELING_ENVY_DESC Sadness and Anger, braided together. Will attack the nearest creature, other than the spellcaster.
@loca HW_FEELING_GUILT_NAME Feeling: Guilt
@loca HW_FEELING_GUILT_DESC Joy and Fear, braided together. Can't take bonus actions. Has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on Wisdom <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throws</LSTag>.
@loca HW_FEELING_HOPE_NAME Feeling: Hope
@loca HW_FEELING_HOPE_DESC Trust and Anticipation, braided together. Adds 1d4 to <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> and <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throws</LSTag>.
@loca HW_FEELING_LOVE_NAME Feeling: Love
@loca HW_FEELING_LOVE_DESC Joy and Trust, braided together. <LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass">Armour Class</LSTag> and <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throws</LSTag> increased by 1, and <LSTag Tooltip="Resistant">Resistant</LSTag> to all damage. The spellcaster takes the same damage.
@loca HW_FEELING_MORBIDNESS_NAME Feeling: Morbidness
@loca HW_FEELING_MORBIDNESS_DESC Joy and Disgust, braided together. The first time it deals damage with a weapon each turn, it regains [1].
@loca HW_FEELING_OPTIMISM_NAME Feeling: Optimism
@loca HW_FEELING_OPTIMISM_DESC Joy and Anticipation, braided together. Cannot be <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FRIGHTENED">Frightened</LSTag>. Gains temporary hit points each turn.
@loca HW_FEELING_OUTRAGE_NAME Feeling: Outrage
@loca HW_FEELING_OUTRAGE_DESC Surprise and Anger, braided together. Has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag>, and attacks against it have <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag>.
@loca HW_FEELING_PESSIMISM_NAME Feeling: Pessimism
@loca HW_FEELING_PESSIMISM_DESC Sadness and Anticipation, braided together. Subtracts 1d6 from <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throws</LSTag> and <LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck">Ability Checks</LSTag>.
@loca HW_FEELING_PRIDE_NAME Feeling: Pride
@loca HW_FEELING_PRIDE_DESC Joy and Anger, braided together. Scores a <LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit">Critical Hit</LSTag> on a roll of 19 or 20.
@loca HW_FEELING_REMORSE_NAME Feeling: Remorse
@loca HW_FEELING_REMORSE_DESC Sadness and Disgust, braided together. The first time it deals damage each turn, it takes [1].
@loca HW_FEELING_SENTIMENTALITY_NAME Feeling: Sentimentality
@loca HW_FEELING_SENTIMENTALITY_DESC Trust and Sadness, braided together. <LSTag Tooltip="Resistant">Resistant</LSTag> to Psychic damage. Cannot be <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CHARMED">Charmed</LSTag>.
@loca HW_FEELING_SHAME_NAME Feeling: Shame
@loca HW_FEELING_SHAME_DESC Fear and Disgust, braided together. Can't take reactions. Has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag>.
@loca HW_FEELING_SUBMISSION_NAME Feeling: Submission
@loca HW_FEELING_SUBMISSION_DESC Trust and Fear, braided together. Knocked <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PRONE">Prone</LSTag> and can't harm the spellcaster.
@loca HW_FEELING_UNBELIEF_NAME Feeling: Unbelief
@loca HW_FEELING_UNBELIEF_DESC Surprise and Disgust, braided together. Can't cast spells.
@loca HW_FEELING_DISAPPROVED_NAME Disapproved
@loca HW_FEELING_DISAPPROVED_DESC Shaken by an ally's Disapproval. Has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag>.
@loca HW_FEELING_REMORSE_TECH_NAME Remorse
@loca HW_FEELING_MORBIDNESS_TECH_NAME Morbidness
@loca HW_RESONANT_REFUND_TECH_NAME Refund
@loca HW_RESONANT_REFUND_USED_NAME Refund used
@loca HW_RESONANT_OVERLOAD_NAME Overload
@loca HW_RESONANT_OVERLOAD_DESC Everything you made others feel, felt again. It carries over from one fight to the next. The number shows how full it is: at 100% you become Overloaded. From level 5, Emotional Overload releases it.
@loca HW_RESONANT_OVERLOAD_FULL_NAME Overloaded
@loca HW_RESONANT_OVERLOAD_FULL_DESC Overwhelmed by everything you made others feel. You can't cast spells, your weapon attacks deal an additional [1], and you take Psychic damage equal to your spell slot level at the start of each of your turns. It lasts a number of turns equal to your level; from level 5, Emotional Overload ends it at once.
@loca HW_RESONANT_OVERLOAD_SPENT_TECH_NAME Overload spent
@loca HW_RESONANT_JOY_CONTAGION_NAME Contagious Joy
@loca HW_RESONANT_JOY_CONTAGION_DESC Has <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag> on the next attack.
@loca HW_RESONANT_SURPRISE_OPENING_NAME Off Guard
@loca HW_RESONANT_SURPRISE_OPENING_DESC The next attack against it has <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag>.
@loca HW_RESONANT_ANGER_FALLBACK_NAME Lashing Out
@loca HW_RESONANT_ANGER_FALLBACK_DESC Angry with no one to blame: attacks the nearest creature, other than the spellcaster.
@loca HW_RESONANT_TRUST_SHOULDERED_NAME Shouldered
@loca HW_RESONANT_TRUST_SHOULDERED_DESC <LSTag Tooltip="Resistant">Resistant</LSTag> to the blow an ally is sharing with it.
@loca HW_RESONANT_GRUDGE_NAME Grudge
@loca HW_RESONANT_GRUDGE_DESC Bears a grudge against whoever hurt it last and attacks them.
@loca HW_CATHARSIS_NAME Catharsis
@loca HW_CATHARSIS_DESC Opposing emotions, snapped at once. Every mood is spent.
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_EMOTIONALALCHEMY_NAME Emotional Alchemy
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_EMOTIONALALCHEMY_DESC When your Weave Surge touches a creature that already carries a mood, the threads react instead of surging, and the mood is spent.<br><br>Neighbouring emotions braid into a feeling, such as <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FEELING_LOVE">Love</LSTag>, that lasts 2 turns.<br><br>Opposing emotions snap into <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CATHARSIS">Catharsis</LSTag>: an enemy takes [1] and an ally regains [2].<br><br>When your Weave Surge causes a reaction, you regain the spell slot it used. Once per turn.
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_OVERLOAD_NAME Overload
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_OVERLOAD_DESC You feel what you make others feel. Each emotion that takes hold fills your Overload a little, and each reaction fills it more; it carries over from one fight to the next. At 100% you become Overloaded: you can't cast spells, your weapon attacks deal extra Psychic damage, and you take Psychic damage each turn, for a number of turns equal to your level. From level 5, Emotional Overload ends it at once.
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_EMPATHICSIGHT_NAME Empathic Sight
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_EMPATHICSIGHT_DESC You read the threads of feeling in others. You have <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag> on Insight checks.
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_COMPLEXFEELINGS_NAME Complex Feelings
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_COMPLEXFEELINGS_DESC Emotions two steps apart on the wheel now braid into complex feelings, such as <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FEELING_HOPE">Hope</LSTag> or <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FEELING_DESPAIR">Despair</LSTag>.
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_OVERWHELM_NAME Overwhelm
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_OVERWHELM_DESC A Weave Surge on a creature whose mood echoes the same emotion pulls the thread tight into its overwhelming form, such as <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="EMOTION_ECSTASY">Ecstasy</LSTag> or <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="EMOTION_TERROR">Terror</LSTag>.
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_MIXEDFEELINGS_NAME Mixed Feelings
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_MIXEDFEELINGS_DESC Emotions three steps apart on the wheel now braid into mixed feelings, such as <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FEELING_DELIGHT">Delight</LSTag> or <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FEELING_SHAME">Shame</LSTag>.
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_FEELINGREMORSE_NAME Remorse
@loca HW_ARCANA_PASSIVE_FEELINGMORBIDNESS_NAME Morbidness
@loca HW_DEBUG_SHOUT_NAME [DEBUG] Resonant Passives
@loca HW_DEBUG_SHOUT_DESC Grants every Resonant passive until you rest, to test Emotional Alchemy.
@loca HW_DEBUG_STATUS_NAME [DEBUG] Resonant
@loca HW_INTERRUPT_ARCANA_TRUSTSHOULDER_NAME Shoulder to Shoulder
@loca HW_INTERRUPT_ARCANA_TRUSTSHOULDER_DESC When a nearby ally is hit by an attack, share the blow: the ally is Resistant to it, and you take the same damage.
@loca HW_INTERRUPT_ARCANA_ANTICIPATIONGUARD_NAME On Guard
@loca HW_INTERRUPT_ARCANA_ANTICIPATIONGUARD_DESC When an enemy enters your reach, attack it first.

